graph TD
    classDef pathA stroke:#33cc33,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef pathB stroke:#3385ff,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef failover stroke:#ff3333,stroke-width:2px;

    Caller[📞 Caller] -->|1. Inbound Call| Vobiz[☎️ Vobiz SIP Trunk]
    Vobiz -->|2. HTTP POST Webhook| Express[🚀 Express Backend]
    Express -->|3. Read Flag| JSON[🗃️ Inline JSON Config]
    
    %% Path A: Direct PSTN
    Express -->|4a. direct_pstn| VobizDirect[Forward Command]:::pathA
    VobizDirect -->|Direct Route| BackupPSTN[📱 Backup Mobile]:::pathA
    
    %% Path B: Internet First
    Express -->|4b. internet_first| LK_SDK[Provision Rule & Start 10s Timer]:::pathB
    LK_SDK -->|5. SIP Bridge| LiveKit[🌐 LiveKit SIP Room]:::pathB
    LK_SDK -->|6. Trigger VoIP Push| SmartPhone[📲 User App]:::pathB
    
    %% Success Sub-path
    SmartPhone -->|7a. Joins Room within 10s| LiveKit:::pathB
    LiveKit -->|8. Webhook: Connected| Express:::pathB
    Express -->|9. clearTimeout| CancelTimer[🛑 Cancel Timer]:::pathB
    
    %% Timeout/Failover Sub-path
    LK_SDK -.->|7b. Timer Expires after 10s| VobizAPI[Vobiz REST API]:::failover
    VobizAPI -->|10. Redirect Active Leg| BackupPSTN:::failover